<!--
    Checkstyle suppressions for violations that already existed when the style gate was introduced.

    SHRINK-ONLY. Every entry is a file that violated the ruleset at that point. Fix the violation and delete the
    entry; never add an entry to make a build pass. The baseline was 103 violations across 35 files:
    46 MethodName, 41 LineLength, 12 NeedBraces, 3 MemberName, 1 LocalVariableName.

    Suppression is per file and per check rather than per line, so entries do not drift when line numbers move. The
    trade-off is that a new violation of the same check inside one of these files is not caught, which is the reason
    to empty this file. See ../TODO-20260916.md item 2.
-->
